1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:01,870
Singapore.

2
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:03,160
Almost midnight.

3
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:08,920
This is Wei Ling.

4
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:11,800
She runs a kopi shop in Jalan Besar.

5
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,190
The shop closed at nine.

6
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:15,380
Now the second job starts.

7
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:18,740
The licence needs a form and four documents.

8
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,052
She has them all.

9
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,520
She attaches them, one by one,

10
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,469
and checks the address twice.

11
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:26,590
WEI LING: Okay.

12
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:27,520
WEI LING: Send.

13
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:30,400
Her email joins all the others

14
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:32,205
heading for the same desk.

15
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:35,620
This is Rahim, a licensing officer.

16
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:37,880
Hers is one of thirty-eight.

17
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:40,990
He checks the only way he can:

18
00:00:41,010 --> 00:00:42,310
the form on one side,

19
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:43,980
the documents on the other.

20
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:46,080
RAHIM: Twelve.

21
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:47,420
RAHIM: Or twenty-one?

22
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:49,370
The unit number on the

23
00:00:49,390 --> 00:00:51,729
tenancy doesn't match the form.

24
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,680
He writes back.

25
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:56,370
Short, because forty more are waiting.

26
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:58,660
He knows what he means.

27
00:00:58,680 --> 00:00:59,830
She doesn't.

28
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:04,810
UNCLE: Kopi-O kosong, one kaya toast!

29
00:01:06,810 --> 00:01:08,130
WEI LING: Which document?

30
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:09,400
She can't tell.

31
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:11,270
So she guesses, changes the form,

32
00:01:11,290 --> 00:01:13,210
and sends everything again.

33
00:01:14,670 --> 00:01:15,760
On the next pass,

34
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:18,695
he notices the hygiene certificate has expired.

35
00:01:21,870 --> 00:01:23,830
RAHIM: Which version is this?

36
00:01:24,910 --> 00:01:26,350
Hundreds of emails.

37
00:01:26,370 --> 00:01:27,750
Dozens of applicants.

38
00:01:27,770 --> 00:01:30,030
One spreadsheet trying to hold it all.

39
00:01:42,470 --> 00:01:43,550
PermitFlow.

40
00:01:43,570 --> 00:01:45,510
One application, from draft to licence,

41
00:01:45,530 --> 00:01:47,450
with every step on record.

42
00:01:48,970 --> 00:01:50,530
In PermitFlow, whoever applies for

43
00:01:50,550 --> 00:01:52,210
the business is the operator.

44
00:01:52,230 --> 00:01:54,470
Here, that's Wei Ling.

45
00:01:56,090 --> 00:01:57,880
Nine nineteen, same table.

46
00:01:57,900 --> 00:02:01,330
Four sections, then four documents, one slot each.

47
00:02:01,890 --> 00:02:04,530
Every PDF is read against her form.

48
00:02:04,550 --> 00:02:06,130
The unit number matches.

49
00:02:06,150 --> 00:02:07,460
The expired certificate is

50
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,930
flagged the same evening,

51
00:02:08,950 --> 00:02:10,630
not in week six.

52
00:02:10,650 --> 00:02:12,470
Her renewal is on its way.

53
00:02:12,490 --> 00:02:15,630
The check never blocks, so she submits.

54
00:02:15,650 --> 00:02:17,550
Rahim's queue: already checked.

55
00:02:17,570 --> 00:02:20,150
His note names the exact document, and why.

56
00:02:20,170 --> 00:02:21,770
When he requests resubmission,

57
00:02:21,790 --> 00:02:23,310
only that slot reopens.

58
00:02:23,330 --> 00:02:23,470
WEI LING: Oh.

59
00:02:23,490 --> 00:02:25,110
WEI LING: Just the certificate.

60
00:02:25,130 --> 00:02:26,490
She replaces one file.

61
00:02:26,510 --> 00:02:28,030
Checked again: verified.

62
00:02:28,050 --> 00:02:30,717
Revision 2, nothing else re-entered.

63
00:02:30,737 --> 00:02:33,077
RAHIM: Only the certificate changed.

64
00:02:33,097 --> 00:02:34,568
He resolves it.

65
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:39,330
He approves, and the licence is issued at once.

66
00:02:41,890 --> 00:02:43,770
The AI check helps both of them.

67
00:02:43,790 --> 00:02:45,990
She gets plain words and what to do.

68
00:02:46,010 --> 00:02:48,190
He gets the proof, quoted from the document:

69
00:02:48,210 --> 00:02:50,050
no more side by side.

70
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:53,970
And the AI never decides.

71
00:02:53,990 --> 00:02:56,050
Every status change and every

72
00:02:56,070 --> 00:02:58,390
decision carries a person's name.

73
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:02,910
WEI LING: Morning, Uncle.

74
00:03:03,230 --> 00:03:04,150
Checks help you.

75
00:03:04,170 --> 00:03:05,590
Officers decide.
